        "title": "Nking o! baanch’ra nun lu",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Nking o! baanch’ra nun lu,",
            "“Guangthanh puanhmei himdai diu;",
            "Dih khou chuzaengmei nai diu,",
            "Paapmei nun ta guat sulou!”",
            "Zaatguai zaenggai na, thau tho,",
            "Rih ngam lu tei suancham kho;",
            "Baanch’ra nun rui din bam e,",
            "“Khrista Bethlehem khou puan!”",
            "",
            "Nking o! baanch’ra nun lu,",
            "“Guangthanh puanhmei himdai diu.”",
            "",
            "2. Kauh liangmei khou thuanku kho,",
            "Khrista, tingsaeng Poubaumei;",
            "Kiruai kuak khou Guangh ‘khat puan,",
            "Baanch’ra guai rui suan bam e,",
            "“Chuzaengmei lungchammei nai diu;”",
            "Pingmei lung nthaek kandiu,",
            "Khrista dih khou guanglou the,",
            "Jisu, ‘niu Immanuel!",
            "",
            "3. Thuanku o! tingkau Guangh Na!",
            "Thuan o! nchumhmei riu ta!",
            "Ringmei riu tei phung guang e,",
            "Meiguai ta tigailou khang,",
            "Niamh gaimei him khou zipbam,",
            "Maansei rui theidat zat mak khang,",
            "Panti kathanh tilouna,",
            "Aniu ta zaithaulou e."
          ]
        }
      }
